    "title": "KJV Bible online Large Print",
    "description": "Free KJV Bible online Large Print, the best app to read the Holy Word in large print for free. A very user-friendly format specially designed for the visually impaired. \r\n\r\nThe Bible is a book of the books, the message of God. Now you can read and explore it with an intuitive and easy to use app. It contains the UKJV Updated King James Version. This version is the beloved King James Version with some word changes in the case of some archaic words. \r\n\r\nKJV Bible online Large Print is offered to the Christian readers for free as a unique Bible study tool, provinding a combination of features found in no other Bible:\r\n\r\nABOUT THIS SPECIAL BIBLE\r\n- UKJV Updated King James Version\r\n- It's free\r\n- Offline, no internet connection required\r\n- Easy to read, easy to carry, always on your phone\r\n- Audio Bible: listen as you read, verse by verse, chapter by chapter.\r\n\r\nMORE FEATURES\r\n- Highlight verses with colors and save your favorites in a dated list for access at any time\r\n- You can make annotations \r\n- The app remembers where you left off\r\n- In addition to the large print format, you can change the font size displayed on the screen. \r\n- Use night mode when reading in the dark\r\n\r\nSHARE THE WORD OF GOD\r\nAnother unique feature of this app is the posibility of sharing the Word. It's free and easy and your friends will thank you. \r\n- You can send verses by email, Messenger or WhatsApp \r\n- Post Bible verses and passages directly on Facebook or other social networks.\r\n- The app allows you to create beautiful images with verses to share.\r\n\r\nALL THE FEATURES ARE FREE\r\nDownlod it now!\r\nNAMES OF ALL BOOKS OF THE OLD AND NEW TESTAMENT\r\nOld Testament: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Pentateuch (Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy) and Historical books (Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther) \r\n\u2022 Poetic books (Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon) \r\n\u2022 Prophetic Books (Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, and Malachi) \r\n\r\n  New Testament: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Matthew, Mark, Luke, John and Acts of the Apostles  \r\n\u2022 Letters from St. Paul (Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews) General Letters (James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude.) \r\n\u2022 Prophetic: Revelation",
    "descriptionHTML": "Free KJV Bible online Large Print, the best app to read the Holy Word in large print for free. A very user-friendly format specially designed for the visually impaired. <br><br>The Bible is a book of the books, the message of God. Now you can read and explore it with an intuitive and easy to use app. It contains the UKJV Updated King James Version. This version is the beloved King James Version with some word changes in the case of some archaic words. <br><br>KJV Bible online Large Print is offered to the Christian readers for free as a unique Bible study tool, provinding a combination of features found in no other Bible:<br><br>ABOUT THIS SPECIAL BIBLE<br>- UKJV Updated King James Version<br>- It&#39;s free<br>- Offline, no internet connection required<br>- Easy to read, easy to carry, always on your phone<br>- Audio Bible: listen as you read, verse by verse, chapter by chapter.<br><br>MORE FEATURES<br>- Highlight verses with colors and save your favorites in a dated list for access at any time<br>- You can make annotations <br>- The app remembers where you left off<br>- In addition to the large print format, you can change the font size displayed on the screen. <br>- Use night mode when reading in the dark<br><br>SHARE THE WORD OF GOD<br>Another unique feature of this app is the posibility of sharing the Word. It&#39;s free and easy and your friends will thank you. <br>- You can send verses by email, Messenger or WhatsApp <br>- Post Bible verses and passages directly on Facebook or other social networks.<br>- The app allows you to create beautiful images with verses to share.<br><br>ALL THE FEATURES ARE FREE<br>Downlod it now!<br>NAMES OF ALL BOOKS OF THE OLD AND NEW TESTAMENT<br>Old Testament: <br><br>\u2022 Pentateuch (Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy) and Historical books (Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther) <br>\u2022 Poetic books (Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon) <br>\u2022 Prophetic Books (Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, and Malachi) <br><br>  New Testament: <br><br>\u2022 Matthew, Mark, Luke, John and Acts of the Apostles  <br>\u2022 Letters from St. Paul (Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews) General Letters (James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude.) <br>\u2022 Prophetic: Revelation",
